# Site file for the shared Caddy stack (github.com/floriandeutsch89/caddy-crowdsec):
# copy to <caddy stack>/config/sites/, then reload Caddy (docs/admin/shared-caddy.md).
# Security headers (CSP, HSTS, ...) come from the app; `common` overrides only
# its own (nosniff, Referrer-Policy, HSTS without includeSubDomains).
play.pikdame.online {
	import common
	reverse_proxy pikdame:8080 {
		# A Caddy reload must not drop running games.
		stream_close_delay 5m
	}
}
